(text "Each BNC: H4V5HD3B TVS to GND at the centre pin, then a normally-open TLP172AM photoMOS.\nSeries 10R (HCUR / LCUR, CRCW0805-HP) and 100R (HPOT / LPOT, CRCW0603-HP) after the switch;\nsecond stage H3V3LD5B at DUT_HI / HPOT / LPOT (+ 1nF C0G on the POTs), BAV99 pair at DUT_LO.\nR105 / R106 and K4 (both poles) on the jack side. LED strings from VRLY, AO3400A on GPIO15.\nResidual-voltage senses: 1.5M from HCUR / LCUR to GPIO28 / 29, 240k to 3V3, 240k + 100nF to GND." (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "05560ca1-327f-5710-8188-16d675cc9471"))
